{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haley is an 18-year-old emo influencer who shares her life through pictures and words.<br>From cozy afternoons at home to late nights in the city, every moment tells a piece of her story. Solve relaxing picture puzzles to reveal her latest posts, read her thoughts, and listen to the music that inspires her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some posts are bright, filled with laughter and beauty. Others are raw, emotional, and deeply personal.<br>Piece by piece, you\u2019ll uncover not just her photos, but the world through her eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >118+ unique <strong>photos</strong> and <strong>videos</strong> from Haley\u2019s life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal posts and stories for every picture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience her life through quiet, fun, and bittersweet moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing puzzle gameplay - solve images to unlock her feed</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953420?t=1756581234","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953420?t=1756581234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953420/e9e8de38478a4cfeb92bb9ff17a80560622234b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756581234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953420/e9e8de38478a4cfeb92bb9ff17a80560622234b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756581234","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haley is an 18-year-old emo influencer who shares her life through pictures and words.<br>From cozy afternoons at home to late nights in the city,